  `AcpAdapterV2.test.ts` (all `ownDetachedProcessGroup` / `win32` teardown cases): 85 passed. `vp run check:changed`: pass.
- Linux runtime, real Grok CLI 1.0.70. The reporter's matrix run against `grok agent stdio` on Linux passes in every case, so the hang needs Windows console semantics:
